*****************************************************************************/

Purpose
    Prep work before any forms work under kant. Mornings stay on the kant
    docket. Afternoons produce recon and documents only, never trunk code.
    An afternoon finding that needs code becomes a morning docket item.

Steps
    A1  recon charter: the old GUI, read only.
        Part 1 (inventory) and Part 2 (per-attribute recon) done 2026-11-03;
        the rows are in IncantForms/WorkingOn/formsRecon, ready for A3.
    A2  listener probe: does field=$anotherField (listen, and receive on
        change) work on the new road?
    A3  attribute table: one row per attribute, columns
            moment      define / layout / event
            inherited   yes / no
            has action  yes / no
            depends on  other attributes, registries, C++ calls
            status      known / recon / drop
        Built from formsRecon.
    A4  first-light form: the smallest form touching all three moments --
        a window, down, border, text, one button.
    A5  foreign-call design, paper only until the jitter settles: a C++
        method with several arguments or non-kant types is reached through a
        declared signature; the jitter emits a glue body that reads the
        field's members and calls the C++, so kant keeps one signature.
    Later: the drawing language, then print / typesetting.

Folded in from the forms notes
    Style is ruled: no implicit style updates; title names its style in its
        own definition.
    The Buffer mark is the first thing to check for pouring text.
    Comments in a form are // text, with no braces in action bodies.
    Vertical align is dropped in favour of space.

Where the old GUI lives (A1 Part 1)
    Groups/GUI/                 tracked in Groups; 8,251 lines of .twk/.rtn/
                                .act/.g. The attribute dispatch table is
                                Bwana.twk registerMethods (mapMethod); the
                                attribute methods are Map.rtn; layout, fit
                                and flex are Control.twk and Details.twk;
                                sheet / matrix is Stuff/Sheet.rtn.
    InProcess/Bot/              not a git repo; a variant of the same GUI,
                                dated 2021-03-24 against Groups/GUI's
                                2021-03-09, so slightly newer. Same file set
                                plus BotClient/BotServer/PDF/RunBot; about
                                1,900 differing lines across Actions,
                                Control, Details, DrawPoint, Layout, Map,
                                Stylish. Bot/GUI is a symlink to Groups/GUI.
    Groups/Layout.twk, Stylish.twk, GroupDraw.twk   the 2026-07 rewrite,
                                not old GUI; read only for comparison.
    IncantForms/Controls/       templates, attributes, traits: the form
                                side's own registries (tEMPLATEs, pROPERTIEs,
                                sTYLEs, cOLOr, fONTs).

